# Explicit Git path budget: source/config/docs/tests <= 450 KiB;
# dist/ <= 1 MiB, public/ <= 500 KiB, lockfile <= 100 KiB. Total < 8 MiB.
# These generated paths have a zero-byte submission budget at every depth.
**/node_modules/
**/.vite/
**/.cache/
**/.npm/
test/scratch/
*.tsbuildinfo
# dist/ is deliberately included: static hosting serves the production export.
